<title>USA: Milwaukee County, Wis., GOs won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee County, Wis., GOs won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said Thursday it won Milwaukee County, Wis.'s $43.9 million general obligation bond deal at a true interest cost of 5.33 percent.</p>
</text>
